# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on
[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), and this
project adheres to
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]
### Added
- New `--compact` flag that collapses short block collections into flow
  style when they fit within the configured line width.
- Support for `.qmd` files.
### Fixed
- Crash when the input ended without a trailing newline
  ([#123](https://github.com/example/widget/issues/123)).

## [1.0.0] - 2024-01-15
### Changed
- __Breaking:__ renamed `widget make` to `widget build`.

